window.SOURCE_NOTES=["Note: S5/S6 are transcriptions of government indexes, not originals. Underlying originals to pull on FamilySearch (free login): Minnesota Death Index 1908\u20132017; U.S. SSA Applications and Claims Index; BIRLS death file.", "Note: FT-1834 Ringsted k\u00f8bstad was skimmed in full: bsids 4460 N\u00f8rregade, 4461 Sankt Bendts Gade, 4462 Sankt Hans Gade, 4463 S\u00f8gade, 4464 Torvet (33 images). It has 1 unmarried Peter/Peder Johansen and 1 Ane Marie Hansdatter of the right age. No Ane Marie Clausdatter was seen.", "Note: **No Lena** on 1875. Dig 52 1880 listed sister **Lena 10** \u2014 age fits 1875 **Caroline 4** (~9\u201310 in 1880). Possible same daughter (name variant) \u2014 flag only; do not merge without Genealogist."];
